# PLP desktop header (Figma)

Figma: [desktop-model2](https://www.figma.com/design/x4y3qlCXNd3ZB6ocY09PPm/infinity-Store--main-?node-id=10151-23342) · [search bar](https://www.figma.com/design/x4y3qlCXNd3ZB6ocY09PPm/infinity-Store--main-?node-id=10151-23345)

## Top row (`PLPDesktopHeaderTopBar`)

- **Grid (RTL):** actions `justify-self-start` (right) · logo center · search `justify-self-end` (left)
- **Logo:** `@repo/brand` `StorefrontLogo` **92×58**
- **Container:** `StorefrontContainer` + `py-3` (same vertical rhythm as pre-Figma header)
- **Header chrome bg:** unchanged in `(product)` / `(blog)` layouts (`bg-white/80`, `glass-panel` on scroll) — do not replace with `stone/50` on the sticky bar

## Search (`PLPDesktopSearch`)

| Token | Value |
|-------|--------|
| Width | `282px` default; expands to `360px` / `lg:420px` on focus or open dropdown |
| Motion | `transition-all duration-300`, `focus-within:ring-2 ring-pink-200`, `shadow-sm`, submit `hover:scale-105`, dropdown `animate-in fade-in slide-in-from-top-2` |
| Radius | `28px` |
| Fill | `bg-stone-50` + `border-slate-50` (search control only) |
| Padding | `py-2 pl-2 pr-5` |
| Submit | `h-8 w-9` pink pill, white search glyph |
| Placeholder | 12px, `neutral-400` — «دنبال چی میگردی؟» |
| Layout | `dir="ltr"` on inner row — pink search button on the **left**, RTL text input on the right |

Suggestions dropdown: `min-w-[282px]`, existing PLP search API behavior unchanged.

## Actions (`DesktopActions`)

- `gap-4` (16px), `flex-row-reverse` (cart toward outer edge, profile toward logo)
- Hover: `hover:scale-105` / `active:scale-95` on icon controls
- Cart: icon + **سبد خرید** label, `text-pink-500`, `text-xs`
- Dividers: `h-[20.5px] w-px bg-slate-200`
- Wallet / orders / profile: `text-slate-400`, 24px icons

## Category nav (`DesktopNav`)

- Row: `bg-stone-50`, `py-3`, `StorefrontContainer`, `gap-6` (24px)
- Links: `text-sm`, inactive `text-neutral-800`, active pink pill unchanged

## Mobile

Mobile header (`PLPMobileHeader`) is separate; this rule is desktop-only.
